Z||000006||terryk||03-21-2000||03:41 PM||||The price should be FOB to the dealer meaning they are paying for the shipping to the dealer's address. So if you order from a cheaper place in Arizona and have it delivered to New York, it might cost more than getting it locally.<P>I seem to remember several placed getting around $1500-1600 here in California. I think they went up a bit. I know they started out at $1485.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||87PegasusGT||03-22-2000||03:29 PM||||Just throwing out another option.. TA Creations has low mileage 3.4 starting at $400 w/o accessories and $600 w.  Shipping to Oregon is $200 so I doubt the total cost would run you over $800. That is with about 40-50K miles though.||||reg||1
